<title>USA: Some U.S. corn gluten pellet prices lower.</title>
<headline>Some U.S. corn gluten pellet prices lower.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some corn gluten pellet prices were lower Thursday in very slow trading, while most other gluten products held value, dealers said. &quot;It's very quiet here today (Thursday), a cash source said.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
